<title>JAPAN: Canon Sales plans share split.</title>
<headline>Canon Sales plans share split.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canon Sales Co Ltd said on Monday it planned a 1.1-for-1 share split on February 17, for shareholders as of December 31.</p>
</text>
